  "goodToKnow": "Das Augenmerk is attention or focus, a formal word used in set phrases: sein Augenmerk auf etwas richten or legen (to focus on), besonderes Augenmerk gilt... (special attention goes to...). It's common in reports, speeches and business German. Everyday alternatives: die Aufmerksamkeit, der Fokus. From das Auge (eye) and merken (to notice). It has no plural."
